#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:9
msgid "Deformables"
msgstr "可变形物体"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:11
msgid ""
"A deformable is an asset whose shape changes during simulation. Unlike a "
"rigid body, it has no rigid root frame: its state is the position and "
"velocity of every node of its simulation mesh."
msgstr "可变形物体是在仿真中形状会发生变化的资产。与刚体不同，它没有刚性的根坐标系；其状态由仿真网格中每个节点的位置和速度组成。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:14
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab models three kinds of deformable, distinguished by the "
"dimensionality of the simulated geometry:"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 按仿真几何体的维度，将可变形物体分为三类："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:21
msgid "Property"
msgstr "属性"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:22 source/concepts/deformables.rst:67
