msgstr "三角网格（ ``UsdGeom.Mesh`` ）"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:32
msgid "Open curve (``UsdGeom.BasisCurves``), simulated as capsule segments"
msgstr "开放曲线（ ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves`` ），以胶囊体线段模拟"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:33
msgid "Asset class"
msgstr "资产类"

