msgid ":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject`"
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject`"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:36
msgid ":class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject`"
msgstr ":class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject`"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:37 source/concepts/deformables.rst:232
msgid "Runtime state"
msgstr "运行时状态"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:38 source/concepts/deformables.rst:39
msgid "Nodal positions and velocities"
msgstr "节点位置和速度"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:40
msgid "Per-segment poses and velocities"
msgstr "各线段的位姿和速度"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:42
msgid ""
"Volume and surface deformables share one asset class and one authoring "
"pattern; they differ only in the physics material assigned to them. Cables "
"are a separate asset class with their own spawner, material, and state "
"layout, and are covered in `Cables`_."
msgstr ""
"体积和表面可变形物体使用同一资产类和编写方式，区别仅在于所分配的物理材质。线缆使用独立的资产类，具有自己的生成器、材质和状态布局，详见 `线缆 "
"<Cables_>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:46
msgid ""
"Particle-based materials such as fluids and granular media are not "
"deformables in this sense. They use a separate asset and solver; see "
":doc:`/source/concepts/using_mpm`."
msgstr ""
"流体和颗粒介质等基于粒子的材料不属于这里所说的可变形物体。它们使用独立的资产和求解器；参见 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/using_mpm` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:50
msgid ""
"All three kinds are under active development. On Newton, deformables are "
"implemented in :mod:`isaaclab_newton.assets`, alongside rigid objects and "
"articulations. Cable support in particular is experimental: its spawner cfg,"
" asset class, and material defaults may still change."
msgstr ""
"这三类物体都仍在持续开发。在 Newton 上，可变形物体与刚体物体和关节体一起实现在 :mod:`isaaclab_newton.assets` "
"中。线缆支持尤其处于实验阶段，其生成器配置、资产类和材质默认值仍可能变化。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:57
msgid "Backend support"
msgstr "后端支持情况"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:63 source/concepts/deformables.rst:581
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "类型"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:64
msgid "PhysX"
msgstr "PhysX"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:65
msgid "Newton"
msgstr "Newton"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:66
msgid "OvPhysX"
msgstr "OvPhysX"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:68 source/concepts/deformables.rst:72
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Yes"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:69 source/concepts/deformables.rst:73
#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:77
msgid "Yes, VBD solver only"
msgstr "支持，仅限 VBD 求解器"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:70 source/concepts/deformables.rst:74
msgid "Experimental, CUDA devices only"
msgstr "实验性，仅限 CUDA 设备"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:76 source/concepts/deformables.rst:78
msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:80
msgid ""
"On Newton, deformables of every kind are simulated by the VBD solver, so a "
"scene containing them must select a physics cfg whose solver is VBD. For the"
" solver parameters, for running a rigid robot and a deformable in one scene,"
" and for the tuning workflow, see :doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_vbd` "
"and :doc:`/source/concepts/coupled_solvers`."
msgstr ""
"在 Newton 上，各类可变形物体都由 VBD 求解器模拟，因此包含它们的场景必须选择使用 VBD "
"求解器的物理配置。求解器参数、在同一场景中运行刚性机器人与可变形物体的方法，以及调参流程，见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/solver_tuning_vbd` 和 :doc:`/source/concepts/coupled_solvers` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:85
msgid ""
"OvPhysX deformables carry further restrictions on node counts and startup "
"cost. See :doc:`/source/concepts/physics-backends/ovphysx`."
msgstr ""
"OvPhysX 的可变形体还存在节点数量和启动开销方面的限制，详见 :doc:`/source/concepts/physics-"
"backends/ovphysx` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:90
msgid "Volume and surface deformables"
msgstr "体积和表面可变形物体"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:93
msgid "Authoring"
msgstr "编写资产"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:95
msgid "A deformable is a mesh spawner with two extra fields:"
msgstr "可变形物体使用网格生成器，并增加两个字段："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:97
msgid ""
"``deformable_props``, a backend-specific ``*DeformableBodyPropertiesCfg``. "
"Setting it is what turns the mesh into a deformable at all."
msgstr ""
"``deformable_props`` ：后端特有的 ``*DeformableBodyPropertiesCfg`` "
"。设置此字段才会将网格变为可变形物体。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:99
msgid ""
"``physics_material``, a deformable material cfg. Its type selects volume or "
"surface."
msgstr "``physics_material`` ：可变形材质配置，其类型决定使用体积还是表面模型。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:101
msgid ""
"Wrap the spawner in a :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObjectCfg` to get a"
" runtime asset."
msgstr "将生成器放入 :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObjectCfg` ，即可创建运行时资产。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:121
msgid "The same object on Newton swaps the two backend cfgs:"
msgstr "在 Newton 上，同一物体需要替换这两个后端配置："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:141
msgid ""
"The two backends parameterize elasticity differently: PhysX takes "
"``youngs_modulus`` and ``poissons_ratio``, Newton takes the Lame parameters "
"``k_mu`` and ``k_lambda``. The values above are the same material, converted"
" with ``k_mu = E / (2 * (1 + nu))`` and ``k_lambda = E * nu / ((1 + nu) * (1"
" - 2 * nu))``."
msgstr ""
"这两个后端采用不同的弹性参数：PhysX 使用 ``youngs_modulus`` 和 ``poissons_ratio`` ，Newton "
"使用拉梅参数 ``k_mu`` 和 ``k_lambda`` 。上述值表示同一种材料，通过 ``k_mu = E / (2 * (1 + nu))`` "
"和 ``k_lambda = E * nu / ((1 + nu) * (1 - 2 * nu))`` 转换。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:146
msgid ""
"A surface deformable is authored the same way, with a 2D mesh spawner and a "
"surface material:"
msgstr "表面可变形物体采用同样的方式编写，但使用二维网格生成器和表面材质："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:166
msgid ""
"The material values above are the tuned ones from ``Isaac-Lift-Cloth-"
"Franka`` rather than the defaults. For what each parameter does and what it "
"defaults to, see :doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_vbd`, which also covers "
"cloth self-contact. Self-contact is off by default, so cloth passes through "
"itself until it is enabled."
msgstr ""
"上述材质值来自 ``Isaac-Lift-Cloth-Franka`` 调整后的配置，而非默认值。各参数的作用和默认值见 "
":doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_vbd` ，其中也介绍了布料自接触。自接触默认关闭，因此启用前布料可以穿过自身。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:171
msgid ""
"``edge_refinement`` sets the simulation resolution for both kinds: the "
"maximum surface edge length is the bounding-box diagonal divided by this "
"value, and volume deformables reuse it as the tetrahedralization target. It "
"defaults to ``4.0`` and must be at least ``1.0``. Values near ``1.0`` make "
"tetrahedralization significantly slower."
msgstr ""
"``edge_refinement`` "
"设置这两类物体的仿真分辨率：最大表面边长为包围盒对角线长度除以该值，体积可变形物体也将其作为四面体划分的目标。默认值为 ``4.0`` ，且必须至少为 "
"``1.0`` 。接近 ``1.0`` 的值会显著减慢四面体划分。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:176
msgid ""
"The mesh spawner rejects combinations that cannot work: ``deformable_props``"
" together with ``rigid_props`` or ``mass_props``, or with a "
"``physics_material`` that is not a deformable material, raise a "
":exc:`ValueError` at spawn time."
msgstr ""
"网格生成器会拒绝无法工作的组合： ``deformable_props`` 与 ``rigid_props`` 或 ``mass_props`` "
"同时设置，或配合非可变形材质的 ``physics_material`` ，都会在生成时抛出 :exc:`ValueError` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:181
msgid "Loading from USD"
msgstr "从 USD 加载"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:183
msgid ""
"A deformable can also come from a pre-authored asset. Pass "
"``deformable_props`` and ``physics_material`` to "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.from_files.UsdFileCfg`; the spawner applies "
"the deformable schema to the loaded prim, or modifies it in place if the "
"prim already carries one."
msgstr ""
"可变形物体也可以来自预先编写的资产。将 ``deformable_props`` 和 ``physics_material`` 传给 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.from_files.UsdFileCfg` ；生成器会在加载的 prim "
"上应用可变形模式，如果 prim 已有该模式，则原地修改。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:197
msgid "Volume or surface"
msgstr "体积还是表面"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:199
msgid ""
"There is no explicit type field, and no separate cloth asset class. At "
"authoring time the kind follows from the material cfg: a material deriving "
"from "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.SurfaceDeformableBodyMaterialBaseCfg`"
" produces a surface deformable, and anything else produces a volume "
"deformable. That choice decides what USD is authored, a ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` "
"simulation mesh for volume and a triangle ``UsdGeom.Mesh`` copy of the "
"visual mesh for surface."
msgstr ""
"没有显式的类型字段，也没有独立的布料资产类。编写时，类型由材质配置决定：继承自 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.SurfaceDeformableBodyMaterialBaseCfg`"
" 的材质产生表面可变形物体，其他材质产生体积可变形物体。这决定写入的 USD 内容：体积模型使用 ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` "
"仿真网格，表面模型使用可视网格的三角 ``UsdGeom.Mesh`` 副本。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:206
msgid ""
"At initialization the asset re-derives the kind from the stage. PhysX and "
"OvPhysX read the applied schema on the bound physics material, falling back "
"to mesh topology when that is inconclusive; Newton uses topology alone, "
"treating a ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` under the prim as volume and a plain "
"``UsdGeom.Mesh`` as surface."
msgstr ""
"初始化时，资产从舞台重新判断类型。PhysX 和 OvPhysX 读取绑定物理材质上应用的模式；无法确定时，再根据网格拓扑判断。Newton "
"只使用拓扑，将 prim 下的 ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` 视为体积，将普通 ``UsdGeom.Mesh`` 视为表面。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:211
msgid ""
"So the material cfg is load-bearing: pairing a volume material with a cloth-"
"shaped mesh authors a tetrahedralized solid, not a sheet."
msgstr "因此，材质配置决定实际模型：将体积材质与布料形状的网格搭配，会生成经四面体划分的实体，而不是薄片。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:215
msgid "Tetrahedralization"
msgstr "四面体划分"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:217
msgid ""
"Volume deformables need a tetrahedral simulation mesh. When the spawned prim"
" does not already contain a ``UsdGeom.TetMesh``, Isaac Lab generates one, "
"which requires the optional ``tetrahedralization`` dependencies on every "
"backend:"
msgstr ""
"体积可变形物体需要四面体仿真网格。如果生成的 prim 尚未包含 ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` ，Isaac Lab "
"会生成一个；各后端都需要可选的 ``tetrahedralization`` 依赖："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:228
msgid ""
"Surface deformables never need it, and neither do volume deformables loaded "
"from a USD that already ships a pre-tetrahedralized ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` "
"under the deformable prim."
msgstr ""
"表面可变形物体无需该依赖；从 USD 加载、且可变形 prim 下已包含预先划分的 ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` 的体积物体也不需要。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:234
msgid ""
"The state of a deformable is nodal, expressed in the simulation world frame."
" ``N`` below is "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject.max_sim_vertices_per_body`."
msgstr ""
"可变形物体的状态定义在节点上，以仿真世界坐标系表示。下文的 ``N`` 为 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject.max_sim_vertices_per_body` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:237
msgid ""
"``data.nodal_pos_w`` and ``data.nodal_vel_w``, shape ``(num_instances, N)`` "
"of ``vec3f``, positions [m] and velocities [m/s]."
msgstr ""
"``data.nodal_pos_w`` 和 ``data.nodal_vel_w`` ：形状为 ``(num_instances, N)`` "
"，元素类型为 ``vec3f`` ，分别表示位置 [m] 和速度 [m/s]。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:239
msgid ""
"``data.nodal_state_w``, the same data as ``(num_instances, N)`` of "
"``vec6f``."
msgstr ""
"``data.nodal_state_w`` ：相同数据，形状为 ``(num_instances, N)`` ，元素类型为 ``vec6f`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:240
msgid "``data.default_nodal_state_w``, the spawn state, used for resets."
msgstr "``data.default_nodal_state_w`` ：生成时的状态，用于重置。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:241
msgid ""
"``data.root_pos_w`` and ``data.root_vel_w``, shape ``(num_instances,)``. "
"These are *derived* quantities, computed as the mean over the simulation "
"nodes. There is no root orientation."
msgstr ""
"``data.root_pos_w`` 和 ``data.root_vel_w`` ：形状为 ``(num_instances,)`` 。它们是 "
"*派生量*，由仿真节点的平均值计算得到。不存在根方向。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:244
msgid ""
"Write state back with the indexed setters. "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject.transform_nodal_pos` applies a pose"
" offset relative to the current nodal mean, which is how a spawn-state "
"buffer is scattered across environment origins."
msgstr ""
"通过带索引的设置方法写回状态。 "
":meth:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject.transform_nodal_pos` "
"相对于当前节点均值应用位姿偏移，从而将生成状态缓冲区分配到各环境原点。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:255
msgid ""
"Like every other asset, a :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` "
"integrates with :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene`, "
"``scene.get_state`` / ``scene.reset_to``, and the ``reset_scene_to_default``"
" event term."
msgstr ""
"与其他资产一样， :class:`~isaaclab.assets.DeformableObject` 可与 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` 、 ``scene.get_state`` / "
"``scene.reset_to`` 和 ``reset_scene_to_default`` 事件项集成。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:260
msgid ""
"The unsuffixed writers (``write_nodal_state_to_sim`` and friends) are "
"deprecated in favor of the ``_to_sim_index`` and ``_to_sim_mask`` variants. "
"The mask variants are CUDA-graph capturable."
msgstr ""
"不带后缀的写入方法（ ``write_nodal_state_to_sim`` 等）已弃用，应使用 ``_to_sim_index`` 和 "
"``_to_sim_mask`` 变体。掩码变体支持 CUDA 图捕获。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:264
msgid "Cables"
msgstr "线缆"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:266
msgid ""
"A cable is a 1D rod: a single open ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves`` prim carrying the"
" ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` schema, simulated as a chain of per-"
"segment capsule bodies joined by cable joints."
msgstr ""
"线缆是一维杆：单个开放的 ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves`` prim，带有 "
"``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` 模式，以一串通过线缆关节连接的胶囊体线段进行模拟。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:271
msgid "Cable authoring"
msgstr "编写线缆"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:273
msgid ""
"A cable is configured with a :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.CableCfg`"
" plus a :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.CableMaterialCfg`. Adjacent"
" pairs in ``positions`` become segments, each materialized as a capsule of "
"diameter ``thickness`` and joined to its neighbor by a cable joint. ``N`` "
"control points produce ``N-1`` segment bodies and ``N-2`` joints; the root "
"segment is free-floating."
msgstr ""
"线缆由 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.CableCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.CableMaterialCfg` 配置。 ``positions``"
" 中相邻的点构成线段，每段生成直径为 ``thickness`` 的胶囊体，并通过线缆关节与相邻线段连接。 ``N`` 个控制点产生 ``N-1`` "
"个线段刚体和 ``N-2`` 个关节；根线段自由悬浮。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:283 source/concepts/deformables.rst:347
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:284 source/concepts/deformables.rst:348
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:285
msgid "``positions``"
msgstr "``positions``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:286
msgid ""
"Control points in the cable-local frame [m]. Requires at least **three** "
"finite points, with consecutive points separated by more than ``1e-8`` m."
msgstr "线缆局部坐标系中的控制点 [m]。至少需要 **三个** 坐标值有限的点，且相邻点间距必须大于 ``1e-8`` m。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:288
msgid "``physics_material``"
msgstr "``physics_material``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:289
msgid ""
"Required :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.CableMaterialCfg`; see "
"`Cable material parameters`_. Thickness is also written to the curve's "
"``widths`` attribute so the visual radius matches the physics."
msgstr ""
"必需的 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.CableMaterialCfg` ；见 `线缆材质参数 "
"<Cable material parameters_>`_ 。厚度也会写入曲线的 ``widths`` 属性，使可视半径与物理半径一致。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:292
msgid "``collision_props``"
msgstr "``collision_props``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:293
msgid ""
"Optional collision properties. When omitted, the cable is collision-free; "
"when set (typically ``[UsdPhysicsCollisionCfg(collision_enabled=True)]``), "
"the cable collides with the ground and other cables. See `Cable collision`_."
msgstr ""
"可选的碰撞属性。省略时，线缆不发生碰撞；设置后（通常为 "
"``[UsdPhysicsCollisionCfg(collision_enabled=True)]`` ），线缆会与地面和其他线缆碰撞。见 `线缆碰撞"
" <Cable collision_>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:296
msgid "``visual_material``"
msgstr "``visual_material``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:297
msgid ""
"Optional :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.VisualMaterialCfg` for the"
" curve's appearance."
msgstr ""
"可选的 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.VisualMaterialCfg` ，用于设置曲线外观。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:299
msgid "``visual_material_path``"
msgstr "``visual_material_path``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:300
msgid ""
"Sub-path of the visual material under the cable geometry prim. Defaults to "
"``\"material\"``."
msgstr "可视材质在线缆几何 prim 下的子路径，默认为 ``\"material\"`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:301
msgid "``physics_material_path``"
msgstr "``physics_material_path``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:302
msgid ""
"Sub-path of the physics material under the cable geometry prim. Defaults to "
"``\"physics_material\"``."
msgstr "物理材质在线缆几何 prim 下的子路径，默认为 ``\"physics_material\"`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:328
msgid ""
"This authors a straight 0.9 m red cable along the cable-local x-axis: 9 "
"capsule segments (0.1 m long, 0.03 m diameter) joined by 8 cable joints. The"
" inherited ``init_state`` sets the cable root's spawn pose in each "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"这会沿线缆局部 x 轴生成一条 0.9 m 长的红色直线缆：9 个胶囊体线段（每段长 0.1 m，直径 0.03 m），通过 8 个线缆关节连接。继承的"
" ``init_state`` 设置线缆根节点在各环境中的初始位姿。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:333
msgid "Cable material parameters"
msgstr "线缆材质参数"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:335
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.CableMaterialCfg` defines the "
"cable's geometry and stiffness. All values are validated at author time; "
"nonfinite or out-of-range values raise a :exc:`ValueError` before any prim "
"is created."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials.CableMaterialCfg` "
"定义线缆的几何和刚度。编写时会验证所有值；非有限值或超出范围的值会在创建任何 prim 前抛出 :exc:`ValueError` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:339
msgid ""
"The stiffness fields are elastic moduli, not joint stiffnesses. Each rod "
"joint gets its own discretized stiffness, using that joint's dual rest "
"length ``L = 0.5 * (L_parent + L_child)``, where ``L_parent`` and "
"``L_child`` are the rest lengths of the two segments it spans."
msgstr ""
"刚度字段是弹性模量，不是关节刚度。每个杆关节都有自己的离散化刚度，使用该关节的对偶静止长度 ``L = 0.5 * (L_parent + "
"L_child)`` 计算，其中 ``L_parent`` 和 ``L_child`` 是它连接的两个线段的静止长度。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:349
msgid "``thickness``"
msgstr "``thickness``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:350
msgid ""
"Full cable thickness (diameter) [m]. Must be finite and positive. Used as "
"``radius = thickness / 2`` for the capsule cross-section, the bending second"
" moment of area, and the collision radius. Default ``0.001``."
msgstr ""
"线缆完整厚度（直径）[m]，必须有限且为正。以 ``radius = thickness / 2`` 用于胶囊体截面、弯曲截面二次矩和碰撞半径。默认 "
"``0.001`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:353
msgid "``density``"
msgstr "``density``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:354
msgid ""
"Cable density [kg/m^3]. Must be finite and positive. Per-segment mass is "
"derived from the density and the capsule volume. Default ``1000.0``."
msgstr "线缆密度 [kg/m^3]，必须有限且为正。各线段质量由密度和胶囊体体积计算得到。默认 ``1000.0`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:356
msgid "``stretch_stiffness``"
msgstr "``stretch_stiffness``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:357
msgid ""
"Axial (stretch) elastic modulus ``E`` [Pa]. Must be finite and nonnegative. "
"Becomes the per-joint axial stiffness ``E * A / L``, where ``A`` is the "
"circular cross-section area. Higher values reduce elongation. Default "
"``1.0e9``."
msgstr ""
"轴向（拉伸）弹性模量 ``E`` [Pa]，必须有限且非负。转换为各关节的轴向刚度 ``E * A / L`` ，其中 ``A`` "
"是圆形截面积。值越高，伸长越小。默认 ``1.0e9`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:360
msgid "``bend_stiffness``"
msgstr "``bend_stiffness``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:361
msgid ""
"Bending elastic modulus ``E`` [Pa]. Must be finite and nonnegative. Becomes "
"the per-joint bend stiffness ``E * I / L``, where ``I`` is the second moment"
" of area of the circular cross-section. ``0.0`` gives a limp rope; increase "
"for a stiff hose or wire. Default ``1.0e6``."
msgstr ""
"弯曲弹性模量 ``E`` [Pa]，必须有限且非负。转换为各关节的弯曲刚度 ``E * I / L`` ，其中 ``I`` 是圆形截面的二次矩。 "
"``0.0`` 表示柔软的绳索；增大该值可模拟较硬的软管或电线。默认 ``1.0e6`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:365
msgid "``shear_stiffness``"
msgstr "``shear_stiffness``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:366
msgid ""
"Transverse shear elastic modulus [Pa]. Must be finite and nonnegative. "
"Optional: when left at ``None`` the attribute is not authored and the solver"
" reuses ``stretch_stiffness``. Default ``None``."
msgstr ""
"横向剪切弹性模量 [Pa]，必须有限且非负。可选：保留 ``None`` 时不写入该属性，求解器复用 ``stretch_stiffness`` 。默认"
" ``None`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:369
msgid "``twist_stiffness``"
msgstr "``twist_stiffness``"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:370
msgid ""
"Torsional elastic modulus [Pa]. Must be finite and nonnegative. Optional: "
"when left at ``None`` the attribute is not authored and the solver reuses "
"the bend *structural* stiffness. Default ``None``."
msgstr ""
"扭转弹性模量 [Pa]，必须有限且非负。可选：保留 ``None`` 时不写入该属性，求解器复用弯曲 *结构* 刚度。默认 ``None`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:375
msgid ""
"A cable joint has four degrees of freedom: linear stretch and shear, and "
"angular bend and twist. Leaving ``shear_stiffness`` or ``twist_stiffness`` "
"unset does **not** mean the cable has no shear or twist resistance; it means"
" the solver falls back to the stretch and bend values. Authoring ``0.0`` is "
"distinct from leaving them unset: it removes that resistance."
msgstr ""
"线缆关节具有四种自由度：线性的拉伸和剪切，以及角向的弯曲和扭转。未设置 ``shear_stiffness`` 或 "
"``twist_stiffness`` **并不** 表示线缆没有剪切或扭转阻力，而是由求解器回退到拉伸和弯曲值。显式设置 ``0.0`` "
"与不设置不同：前者会去除该阻力。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:380
msgid ""
"The two fallbacks are not symmetric. Shear reuses the stretch modulus, "
"applied to the same cross-section area. Twist reuses the bend *structural* "
"stiffness ``E * I / L``, whereas an explicitly authored ``twist_stiffness`` "
"is applied to the polar moment ``J = 2 * I``. Setting ``twist_stiffness = "
"bend_stiffness`` therefore gives twice the fallback stiffness, not the same "
"value."
msgstr ""
"这两种回退并不对称。剪切复用拉伸模量，作用于同一截面积；扭转复用弯曲 *结构* 刚度 ``E * I / L`` ，而显式设置的 "
"``twist_stiffness`` 作用于极惯性矩 ``J = 2 * I`` 。因此，设置 ``twist_stiffness = "
"bend_stiffness`` 会得到回退刚度的两倍，而不是相同值。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:386
msgid ""
"Damping is not exposed. The rod joints have damping, but the USD curve-"
"material schema Isaac Lab authors has no attribute for it."
msgstr "未提供阻尼配置。杆关节具有阻尼，但 Isaac Lab 编写的 USD 曲线材质模式中没有对应属性。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:389
msgid ""
"To target a specific axial ``E * A`` or bending ``E * I``, invert these "
"relations to pick the modulus; ``examples/cables.py`` does this from a "
"target stiffness and the segment geometry."
msgstr ""
"如果需要指定轴向 ``E * A`` 或弯曲 ``E * I`` ，可反解这些关系来确定模量； ``examples/cables.py`` "
"演示了如何根据目标刚度和线段几何计算。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:393
msgid "Cable collision"
msgstr "线缆碰撞"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:395
msgid ""
"Collision is opt-in through ``collision_props``. When enabled, the importer "
"applies **adjacent-segment-only** filtering: directly connected segments, "
"which share a joint anchor and would otherwise jitter, are filtered, while "
"every other pair collides. As a result:"
msgstr ""
"碰撞需通过 ``collision_props`` 显式启用。启用后，导入器采用 **仅过滤相邻线段** "
"的规则：直接连接的线段共享关节锚点，不过滤会产生抖动，因此将其过滤；其他所有线段对都发生碰撞。由此："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:399
msgid "The cable collides with the ground and with other cables."
msgstr "线缆会与地面和其他线缆碰撞。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:400
msgid ""
"Non-adjacent segments of the **same** cable collide, so a cable can self-"
"arrest when it loops back on itself."
msgstr "**同一** 线缆的不相邻线段会碰撞，因此线缆回绕自身时可以通过自接触阻止继续运动。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:403
msgid ""
"When ``collision_props`` is omitted, the cable imports as a dynamics-only "
"rod and does not collide."
msgstr "省略 ``collision_props`` 时，线缆作为仅参与动力学的杆导入，不发生碰撞。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:406
msgid "Cable runtime state"
msgstr "线缆运行时状态"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:408
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject` exposes per-segment world state and "
"integrates with :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene`, "
"``scene.get_state`` / ``scene.reset_to``, and the ``reset_scene_to_default``"
" event term."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject` 提供各线段的世界状态，并与 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` 、 ``scene.get_state`` / "
"``scene.reset_to`` 和 ``reset_scene_to_default`` 事件项集成。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:412
msgid ""
"``cable.data.segment_pose_w``, shape ``(num_instances, num_segments)`` of "
"``wp.transformf``, position [m] followed by quaternion ``(x, y, z, w)``. The"
" Torch view has a trailing dimension of 7."
msgstr ""
"``cable.data.segment_pose_w`` ：形状为 ``(num_instances, num_segments)`` ，元素类型为 "
"``wp.transformf`` ，位置 [m] 在前，四元数 ``(x, y, z, w)`` 在后。Torch 视图最后一维的长度为 7。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:415
msgid ""
"``cable.data.segment_velocity_w``, shape ``(num_instances, num_segments)`` "
"of ``wp.spatial_vectorf``, linear [m/s] followed by angular [rad/s]. The "
"Torch view has a trailing dimension of 6."
msgstr ""
"``cable.data.segment_velocity_w`` ：形状为 ``(num_instances, num_segments)`` "
"，元素类型为 ``wp.spatial_vectorf`` ，线速度 [m/s] 在前，角速度 [rad/s] 在后。Torch 视图最后一维的长度为 "
"6。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:418
msgid ""
"``cable.data.default_segment_pose_w`` and ``default_segment_velocity_w``, "
"the spawn state."
msgstr ""
"``cable.data.default_segment_pose_w`` 和 ``default_segment_velocity_w`` "
"：生成时的状态。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:420
msgid ""
"Write per-segment state back with the indexed or masked setters; the masked "
"form is CUDA-graph capturable."
msgstr "通过索引或掩码设置方法写回各线段状态；掩码形式支持 CUDA 图捕获。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:428
msgid ""
"Writes update the maximal-coordinate body state directly, for both "
"simulation states, and flag the affected environments for a solver reset."
msgstr "写入会直接更新两个仿真状态中的最大坐标刚体状态，并将受影响的环境标记为需要重置求解器。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:432
msgid "Loading cables from USD"
msgstr "从 USD 加载线缆"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:434
msgid ""
"Physics is authored in place on the curve: "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.spawn_cable` applies the "
"``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` schema and binds a deformable-curve "
"material, and the curve is imported natively. Topology comes from the "
"curve's own ``points`` and ``curveVertexCounts``; no custom edge attribute "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"物理属性直接写在曲线上： :func:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.spawn_cable` 应用 "
"``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` 模式并绑定可变形曲线材质，曲线随后以原生方式导入。拓扑来自曲线自身的 "
"``points`` 和 ``curveVertexCounts`` ，无需自定义边属性。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:439
msgid ""
"A cable can therefore also be loaded from an external USD, for example one "
"authored in a DCC tool, via "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.from_files.UsdFileCfg`, provided the curve "
"already carries:"
msgstr ""
"因此，也可以通过 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.from_files.UsdFileCfg` 从外部 USD "
"加载线缆，例如在 DCC 工具中编写的资产，前提是曲线已经具备："

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:442
msgid ""
"a single open, linear, nonperiodic ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves`` under the loaded "
"prim,"
msgstr "加载的 prim 下有单个开放、线性、非周期的 ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves`` ；"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:443
msgid "the ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` applied schema, and"
msgstr "已应用 ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` 模式；以及"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:444
msgid ""
"a bound deformable-curve material (``PhysicsCurvesDeformableMaterialAPI``) "
"supplying ``thickness``, ``density``, ``stretchStiffness``, and "
"``bendStiffness`` in the ``physics:`` namespace."
msgstr ""
"已绑定可变形曲线材质（ ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableMaterialAPI`` ），在 ``physics:`` 命名空间中提供 "
"``thickness`` 、 ``density`` 、 ``stretchStiffness`` 和 ``bendStiffness`` 。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:448
msgid ""
"Two failure modes follow from that list. A curve without the sim schema is "
"not part of the deformable import at all and is silently skipped. A curve "
"that has the schema but no resolvable thickness is imported with a default "
"radius and a warning. Author cables through "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.spawn_cable`, or apply the schema and "
"material to the imported prim before construction."
msgstr ""
"这对应两种失败情况。没有仿真模式的曲线不属于可变形物体导入范围，会被静默跳过。具有该模式但无法解析厚度的曲线会使用默认半径导入，并发出警告。请通过 "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.spawn_cable` 编写线缆，或在构造前将模式和材质应用到导入的 "
"prim 上。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:455
msgid "Cable rendering"
msgstr "线缆渲染"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:457
msgid ""
"Cables render in the Kit viewport as ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves``. At render "
"cadence the curve points are refreshed from the cable segment endpoints so "
"the rendered shape always matches the simulation."
msgstr ""
"线缆在 Kit 视口中以 ``UsdGeom.BasisCurves`` 渲染。每次渲染更新时，根据线缆各线段端点刷新曲线点，使渲染形状始终与仿真一致。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:461
msgid ""
"Curve points are synchronized through **CPU** Fabric because the RTX Hydra "
"delegate does not read GPU-backed Fabric arrays for ``BasisCurves`` (NVBug "
"6502662). Periodic curves are skipped by the sync."
msgstr ""
"曲线点通过 **CPU** Fabric 同步，因为 RTX Hydra 委托不会读取 ``BasisCurves`` 的 GPU Fabric "
"数组（NVBug 6502662）。同步时会跳过周期曲线。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:466
msgid "Cable limitations"
msgstr "线缆限制"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:468
msgid ""
"**One standalone, unwelded cable per object.** "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject` requires exactly one ``BasisCurves`` "
"prim carrying ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` under ``prim_path``, holding"
" a single open curve that is not welded to another cable. Multi-curve "
"``BasisCurves`` prims, periodic (closed) curves, and hard coincident curve-"
"to-curve ``PhysicsAttachment`` welds all fail during initialization."
msgstr ""
"**每个对象只能包含一条独立、未与其他线缆焊接的线缆。** :class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject` 要求 "
"``prim_path`` 下恰好有一个带 ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` 的 ``BasisCurves`` "
"prim，其中包含一条未与其他线缆焊接的开放曲线。多曲线 ``BasisCurves`` prim、周期（闭合）曲线，以及曲线之间硬性重合的 "
"``PhysicsAttachment`` 焊接，都会在初始化时失败。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:473
msgid ""
"**Cable ends can be pinned, not clamped.** A ``PhysicsAttachment`` to an "
"xform target lowers to a ball joint, so it constrains position only and the "
"cable pivots freely at the anchor. Rigid plugs and end fittings that must "
"transfer orientation are not representable."
msgstr ""
"**线缆端点可以铰接固定，不能夹紧固支。** 连接到 xform 目标的 ``PhysicsAttachment`` "
"会转换为球关节，因此只约束位置，线缆可以在锚点处自由转动。无法表示需要传递方向约束的刚性插头和端部接头。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:476
msgid ""
"**No damping knobs.** The four stiffness moduli are exposed; their damping "
"counterparts are not."
msgstr "**没有阻尼调节参数。** 提供了四种刚度模量，但没有对应的阻尼参数。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:477
msgid ""
"**CPU-only render sync** (NVBug 6502662); periodic curves are not synced."
msgstr "**渲染同步仅使用 CPU** （NVBug 6502662）；周期曲线不会同步。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:480
msgid ""
"An attachment joint is created only when the attachment stiffness is "
"unauthored or infinite. A finite stiffness is kept as metadata and no joint "
"is created. Both cases are import warnings rather than errors, so the cable "
"initializes normally with the attachment missing. Check the importer output "
"when an attachment appears to have no effect."
msgstr ""
"只有附件刚度未设置或为无穷大时，才会创建附件关节。有限刚度仅保留为元数据，不创建关节。这两种情况均以导入警告而非错误报告，因此线缆仍会正常初始化，即使附件实际缺失。如果附件似乎不起作用，请检查导入器输出。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:486
msgid ""
"Topologies the runtime object rejects still simulate: the physics model is "
"built from the whole USD stage, so every curve carrying "
"``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` is imported whether or not a "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject` wraps it. Drive them through "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` ``get_model()`` / "
"``get_state_0()`` and your own ``newton.selection.ArticulationView``. There "
"is no Isaac Lab asset wrapper for those cases."
msgstr ""
"运行时对象拒绝的拓扑仍会参与仿真：物理模型从整个 USD 舞台构建，因此每条带 ``PhysicsCurvesDeformableSimAPI`` "
"的曲线都会导入，无论是否由 :class:`~isaaclab.assets.CableObject` 包装。可通过 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonManager` 的 ``get_model()`` / "
"``get_state_0()`` 和自行创建的 ``newton.selection.ArticulationView`` "
"控制它们。这些情况没有对应的 Isaac Lab 资产包装器。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:494
msgid "Material parameters in practice"
msgstr "材质参数的实际效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:496
msgid ""
"Each animation below runs the same scene three times, changing one material "
"parameter and holding everything else fixed. The labels give the value used "
"in each run."
msgstr "下方每个动画都将同一场景运行三次，只改变一个材质参数，其余保持不变。标签给出各次运行使用的值。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:502
msgid "A soft ball dropped on a table at three values of Young's modulus"
msgstr "三种杨氏模量下，软球落到桌面上的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:507
msgid ""
"**Young's modulus**: overall stiffness. At ``1e3`` Pa the ball collapses "
"into a pancake on impact; at ``1e5`` Pa it barely deforms. This is the first"
" knob to reach for when a soft body is too floppy or too rigid."
msgstr ""
"**杨氏模量** ：控制整体刚度。设为 ``1e3`` Pa 时，球体撞击后压成扁饼；设为 ``1e5`` Pa "
"时，几乎不变形。软体过软或过硬时，应首先调整此参数。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:511
msgid "A soft ball dropped on a table at three values of Poisson's ratio"
msgstr "三种泊松比下，软球落到桌面上的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:516
msgid ""
"**Poisson's ratio**: how strongly the material preserves volume under "
"compression. At ``0.10`` the ball squashes without spreading. At ``0.49`` it"
" is nearly incompressible, so the same squash has to go somewhere and pushes"
" outward into a wide bulge."
msgstr ""
"**泊松比** ：控制材料受压时保持体积的程度。设为 ``0.10`` 时，球体压扁但不向四周展开；设为 ``0.49`` "
"时，材料近乎不可压缩，同样的压缩会使其向外明显鼓起。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:520
msgid "A soft ball resting on a table at three values of particle radius"
msgstr "三种粒子半径下，软球静置于桌面上的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:525
msgid ""
"**Particle radius**: the contact thickness around each simulation node, not "
"a material property. A larger radius detects contact further from the "
"surface, so the ball rests visibly higher off the table and cannot be "
"compressed as thin. Too small and contacts are missed or detected late; too "
"large relative to the mesh resolution and they start too early."
msgstr ""
"**粒子半径** "
"：各仿真节点周围的接触厚度，并非材质属性。半径越大，越早在远离表面的位置检测到接触，因此球体会明显浮在桌面上方，也无法压得很薄。半径过小可能漏检接触或检测过晚；相对网格分辨率过大，则会过早产生接触。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:533
msgid ""
"A cloth sheet draped over a roller at three values of stretch stiffness"
msgstr "三种拉伸刚度下，布料垂覆在滚筒上的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:538
msgid ""
"**Stretch stiffness**: resistance to in-plane elongation. The low value lets"
" the sheet stretch and sag under its own weight; the high value holds it "
"near its rest length."
msgstr "**拉伸刚度** ：抵抗面内伸长的能力。较低值使布料在自重下拉伸和下垂，较高值则使其保持接近静止长度。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:541
msgid "A cloth sheet falling from a roller at three values of bend stiffness"
msgstr "三种弯曲刚度下，布料从滚筒上落下的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:546
msgid ""
"**Bend stiffness**: resistance to folding. At ``1e-2`` the sheet crumples "
"into a loose heap; at ``1e0`` it keeps large, stiff folds and stays draped "
"over the roller. This is the difference between silk and canvas."
msgstr ""
"**弯曲刚度** ：抵抗折叠的能力。设为 ``1e-2`` 时，布料揉皱成松散的一堆；设为 ``1e0`` "
"时，会保持较大、较硬的褶皱，并继续垂覆在滚筒上。这类似丝绸与帆布的区别。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:553
msgid "A cable spanning two posts at three values of bend stiffness"
msgstr "三种弯曲刚度下，线缆跨在两根支柱之间的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:558
msgid ""
"**Bend stiffness**: at ``1e0`` the cable droops between its supports like "
"slack rope; at ``1e2`` it holds itself straight like a stiff hose."
msgstr "**弯曲刚度** ：设为 ``1e0`` 时，线缆像松绳一样在支撑点之间下垂；设为 ``1e2`` 时，则像较硬的软管一样保持平直。"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:561
msgid ""
"A weighted hanging cable twisted at the top, at three values of twist "
"stiffness"
msgstr "三种扭转刚度下，带配重的悬挂线缆在顶端扭转的效果"

#: source/concepts/deformables.rst:566
msgid ""
"**Twist stiffness**: a weighted cable is twisted at its anchor. At ``1e-1`` "
"the twist is absorbed locally and the cable hangs straight. At ``1e1`` "
"torsion is carried along the rod until it buckles and coils into a helix. "
"Set this explicitly when a cable should resist winding, since leaving it "
"unset falls back to the bend value as described above."
msgstr ""
"**扭转刚度** ：在锚点处扭转带配重的线缆。设为 ``1e-1`` 时，扭转在局部被吸收，线缆仍直垂；设为 ``1e1`` "
"时，扭转沿杆传递，直到发生屈曲并卷成螺旋。如果线缆需要抵抗缠绕，应显式设置该值；未设置时会按前述规则回退到弯曲值。"

